%% STM and checkpoint flow — LangGraph checkpointer owns saves
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant O as Orchestrator_LangGraph
  participant CP as Checkpointer
  C->>O: invoke with thread_id
  O->>CP: auto checkpoint on steps
  O->>O: execute node
  O->>CP: auto checkpoint
  O->>O: interrupt payload
  O->>C: surface interrupt awaiting approval
  C->>O: Command resume after Approval
  Note over O: node re-enters from start
  O->>O: continue past interrupt
  O->>CP: auto checkpoint
